      en: ["The bridge spans the Logone River near the town of Bongor.", "It provides a direct link between Chad and the Republic of Cameroon.", "The structure was built as a symbol of bilateral cooperation.", "It replaces the ferry services that were previously the only way to cross.", "The bridge is vital for the transit of Chadian cotton exports.", "The project was co-funded by international development agencies."],
